                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/2.13.23"&gt;2.13.23&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Primary fix&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;v2: a close with commands in flight no longer completes a call with the previous call's reply (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6150672157" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3329" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3329/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3329"&gt;#3329&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6153175255" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3331" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3331/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3331"&gt;#3331&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Additional changes previously only released in v3&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;code&gt;OperationCount&lt;/code&gt; calculation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jnyrup/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jnyrup"&gt;@jnyrup&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4607638797" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3095" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3095/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3095"&gt;#3095&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sentinel: re-elect primary on failover between already-known nodes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/rebaseandpanic/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/rebaseandpanic"&gt;@rebaseandpanic&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4876202100" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3131" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3131/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3131"&gt;#3131&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
